{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":48,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝掌管未來"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"雅各家，稱為以色列名下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從猶大水源出來的，當聽我言！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們指着耶和華的名起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"提說以色列的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻不憑誠實，不憑公義。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們自稱為聖城的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所倚靠的是","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"名為萬軍之耶和華－以色列的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"主說：早先的事，我從古時說明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"已經出了我的口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也是我所指示的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我忽然行做，事便成就。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我素來知道你是頑梗的－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的頸項是鐵的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的額是銅的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我從古時將這事給你說明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在未成以先指示你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得你說：這些事是我的偶像所行的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我雕刻的偶像和我鑄造的偶像所命定的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"你已經聽見，現在要看見這一切；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不說明嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從今以後，我將新事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是你所不知道的隱密事指示你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這事是現今造的，並非從古就有；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在今日以先，你也未曾聽見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得你說：這事我早已知道了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你未曾聽見，未曾知道；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的耳朵從來未曾開通。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我原知道你行事極其詭詐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你自從出胎以來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便稱為悖逆的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"我為我的名暫且忍怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為我的頌讚向你容忍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不將你剪除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我熬煉你，卻不像熬煉銀子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在苦難的爐中，我揀選你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我為自己的緣故必行這事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我焉能使我的名被褻瀆？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不將我的榮耀歸給假神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華揀選塞魯士為領導者"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"雅各－我所選召的以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當聽我言：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是首先的，也是末後的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我手立了地的根基；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我右手鋪張諸天；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我一招呼便都立住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你們都當聚集而聽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們","poem":1},{"noteId":48},{"text":"內中誰說過這些事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華所愛的人必向巴比倫行他所喜悅的事；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的膀臂也要加在迦勒底人身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟有我曾說過，我又選召他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"領他來，他的道路就必亨通。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要就近我來聽這話：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我從起頭並未曾在隱密處說話；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自從有這事，我就在那裏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在，主耶和華差遣我和他的靈來","poem":1},{"noteId":49},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華對他子民的計劃"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"耶和華－你的救贖主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的聖者如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是耶和華－你的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"教訓你，使你得益處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"引導你所當行的路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚願你素來聽從我的命令！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的平安就如河水；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的公義就如海浪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的後裔也必多如海沙；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你腹中所生的也必多如沙粒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的名在我面前必不剪除，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不滅絕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"你們要從巴比倫出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從迦勒底人中逃脫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以歡呼的聲音傳揚說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華救贖了他的僕人雅各！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要將這事宣揚到地極。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華引導他們經過沙漠。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們並不乾渴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他為他們使水從磐石而流，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"分裂磐石，水就湧出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡人必不得平安！","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":48,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：偶像","reference":{"chapter":48,"verse":14}},{"noteId":49,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：耶和華和他的靈差遣我來","reference":{"chapter":48,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/48.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/49.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/47.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}